- python3 spectrum.py --mode commercial --zone bedroom --grid x1_y1 --consent-granted true
- Phase 2: Deep Vital-Sign Scan (Health & Sleep) / 阶段 2：深度体征生算
- Use this for sleep monitoring or anomaly detection. It takes raw ADC data and processes FFTs. / 用于睡眠监测或异常告警，处理原始 ADC 矩阵。
- python3 spectrum.py --mode raw_compute --zone bedroom --grid x1_y1 --consent-granted true
- Phase 3: Multimodal Linkage / 阶段 3：多模态潜意识联动
